 "All 4 disk images (dc, rd-01, rd-02, file) carry EWF acquisition metadata: CaseNumber=20180905-001, Examiner=Clint Barton, FTK Imager, acquired Fri Sep 7 2018 (01:43-23:14). Memory captures dc/rd01/rd02/file/wkstn05 have Volatility SystemTime 2018-09-06 18:57-22:57 UTC.",
