 "base-wkstn-01-mem.img has Volatility SystemTime 2021-09-16 03:05:13 UTC (Win10 1709), three years after the incident, with empty cmdline/netscan/consoles and a normal Win10 process set. It does not belong to the 2018 acquisition and contains no 2018 intrusion evidence. wkstn-01 has no disk image either, so wkstn-01 cannot be assessed for the 2018 incident from this evidence.");
